# Code owners for paths restricted to project maintainers.
#
# These complement .github/workflows/auto-close-restricted-paths.yml, which
# auto-closes outside PRs touching these paths. With "Require review from Code
# Owners" enabled in the branch ruleset, changes to these paths also require an
# approval from one of the owners below.
#
# Ownership is delegated to the @google/filament GitHub team; manage the list
# of owners through the team's membership rather than by editing this file.
#
# Note: the last matching pattern takes precedence.

# CI/CD configuration, workflows, and this file.
/.github/       @google/filament

# glTF loader library.
/libs/gltfio/   @google/filament

# Generated documentation. Normally updated only by the automated filamentbot
# process (regenerated from docs_src/ on postsubmit via direct push).
/docs/          @google/filament
